{"id":"d52e87f48c923056","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measurability-property.md","title":"ZFC Measurability Property","display":"df-zfc-measurability-property — ZFC Measurability Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measurability-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measurability-property"],"display":"df-zfc-measurability-property — ZFC Measurability Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measurability-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measurability-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measurability-property — ZFC Measurability Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topological carrier, topology, and pointclass).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (measure-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq X\">\\(B\\subseteq X\\)</span> (sets bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (exact source predicates).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measurability\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\\land A\\triangle B\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A\\triangle B)=0\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measurability\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\\land A\\triangle B\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A\\triangle B)=0\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurability is relative to both an explicit measure space and the topology that determines the Borel comparison sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measurability\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurabilityProperty}_S(\\Gamma;X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X,\\tau)\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\\land A\\triangle B\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A\\triangle B)=0\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2532","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-measurability-property.md|58-df-zfc-measurability-property]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9375de7089953a2b","83a15c7e9b3817dc","815e63e5071e7b58"]}